    "rationale": "A fully independent implementation starting from all 80 M40 payloads exactly reproduced four q/O populations, 48 finite sweep points, 16 blocking points, robust component and D8 transaction ledgers, and the accepted M394 q32/O4 anchor. The common cmd32/L8 baseline is 742,148,386 cycles. q16/O8, q32/O4, q64/O2 and q128/O1 reach 1.0963411703x, 1.1093194341x, 1.0954503389x and 1.0161190263x respectively; none reaches the frozen 1.15x selected-RTL gate. M397's NO_GO is therefore accepted: q32/O4 remains the implementation anchor and fixed-product q/O scaling should be closed as a performance axis."
